url: "https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=kabartay.tokenwatchclaude"
abstract: >-
  A Visual Studio Code extension that shows Claude Code's usage limits in the
  status bar: the 5-hour and weekly quota, a countdown to each reset, a pace
  forecast and the fill of the current session's context window. It reuses the
  login Claude Code already stores, talks only to Anthropic's own usage endpoint,
  backs off under that endpoint's tight shared rate limit, and keeps the last
  good numbers on screen. Written in strict TypeScript with a clean
  architecture whose layer boundaries are enforced by lint, with no runtime
  dependencies and no telemetry. Unofficial; not affiliated with Anthropic.
keywords:
  - Claude Code
